{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One pathogen type</strong> (virus) to control and evolve, starting with basic mutations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global infection map</strong>: interact with real-world parameters like climate, transportation, and healthcare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core mechanics</strong>: Learn how to evolve your virus and spread it across the globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Global impact</strong>: Observe how your virus interacts with the world, adapting to governmental actions and environmental conditions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo version limitations:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only <strong>one pathogen type</strong> (virus) is available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress does not transfer</strong> to the full version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some features, such as <strong>in-game purchases</strong>, may be unavailable (does not affect gameplay)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682840?t=1747383382","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682840?t=1747383382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682840/f5345fe525cf51feb2c7b8ef870331c8d17653b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747383382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682840/f5345fe525cf51feb2c7b8ef870331c8d17653b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747383382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's included in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One p